# The shen-rust pin for the rust stage-2 target. .github/workflows/shen-rust.yml
# checks this SHA out and the tests under -tags shen_rust compare the
# checkout to it. The first bare 40-hex line below is the pin.
#
# shen-rust v0.1.2 (2026-11-11), tag v0.1.2. Workspace version 0.1.2.
# Not published to crates.io. (port) and (release) report 0.1.2.
# *version* stays "43.4".
#
# Moved from v0.1.1 (a653699c2f3c60efbce3d63e4045779b5e2777b3). That release
# registered value/or only after shen.initialise, so yggdrasil patched the
# generated main. v0.1.2 registers value/or, <-address/or and <-vector/or
# inside boot_aot_slice before kernel top-level forms and shen.initialise.
# Feature selection is unchanged: eval-free shakes get default-features =
# false; needs-eval=true adds interpreter only.
c8e3f0aa30897e377f14e929e2183ac47e37de9b
